"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Matrix-free Measurement Mitigation\"\n"
"      description=\"Ang Matrix-free Measurement Mitigation (M3) ay isang package para sa scalable na quantum measurement error mitigation na maaaring kalkulahin nang parallel.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-mthree/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: M3\"\n"
"      linkText=\"I-browse ang dokumentasyon\"\n"
